                                "sense_id": "1489d7ca-e514-31e7-baee-8f1c82aa5caa",
                                "text": "Whether by instinct, as in Boston, or by psychological testing, as in St. Louis, some police departments are waking up to the characterological hazards of the police profession. But unfortunately there are still a good many Javerts around."
